<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<scheme version="2.0" title="orange3-cloud: NYC taxi demo" description="Explores and models a whole year of New York City's yellow taxi trips (about 48 million) on a cloud machine: tips by hour, weekday and payment type, distance against fare, kinds of trips, and whether a card trip gets a tip. The machine reads the twelve monthly files from the NYC Taxi and Limousine Commission itself. Start a Medium machine with Cloud settings first.">
