	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(30, 940, 1000, 90)">Start a machine first: Cloud settings… in any Cloud widget, size Medium or larger. Cloud File then makes the machine read the twelve monthly Parquet files of 2025 (about 0.8 GB, 48.7 million trips) from the NYC Taxi and Limousine Commission; nothing goes through this computer. Feature Constructor adds the hour, weekday, duration (minutes), tip percent and whether there was a tip; Select Rows drops impossible trips. Orange's own widgets record these steps, and the machine replays them on all rows. Cash tips aren't recorded, so the tips and the model use card trips.</text>
	</annotations>
	<thumbnail />
